OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe second day of an appeal hearing by
OL,8,Fso-called mushroom murderer Erin
OL,9,FPatterson is under way in an Australian
OL,10,Fcourt
OL,12,FThe 51-year-old was jailed for life
OL,13,Flast year over a lunch laced with
OL,14,Fpoisonous mushrooms, which killed three
OL,15,Fof her relatives and left another
OL,16,Fseverely unwell
OL,18,FPatterson has always maintained the
OL,19,Fdeaths were an accident and her lawyers
OL,20,Fargue she didn't receive a fair trial
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
