OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail for
OL,4,A'truly dreadful' crime, prosecutors
OL,5,Atell appeal court
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors argue that she should stay
OL,8,Fin jail, with no chance for parole for
OL,9,Fthe "truly dreadful" crime
OL,11,FPatterson's lawyers have argued at
OL,12,Fyesterday's hearing that a blunder
OL,13,Fwhich saw the jury accidentally stay in
OL,14,Fthe same hotel as some prosecutors and
OL,15,Fa key witness was "catastrophic" for
OL,16,Fthe integrity of the trial, and that
OL,17,Fseveral pieces of evidence were misused
